OL,3,GNEWSASingle police force for Wales     
OL,4,Acould have serious consequences, says  
OL,5,Aex-commissioner                        
OL,7,FCutting the number of police forces in 
OL,8,FWales from four to one could have      
OL,9,F"serious" consequences, according to a 
OL,10,Fformer police commissioner.            
OL,12,FWinston Roddick said the geography of  
OL,13,Fthe country meant a single force would 
OL,14,Fstruggle to cover Wales adequately, and
OL,15,Fthe current forces - Gwent, south      
OL,16,FWales, Dyfed-Powys and north Wales -   
OL,17,Fare performing well.                   
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
