OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASingle police force for Wales     
OL,4,Acould have serious consequences, says  
OL,5,Aex-commissioner                        
OL,7,FHis comments come as Met Police        
OL,8,Fcommissioner Mark Rowley said the      
OL,9,Fnumber of forces across Wales and      
OL,10,FEngland should be cut from 43 to       
OL,11,Fbetween eight and 10 - or face failure.
OL,13,FThe UK government is considering new   
OL,14,Fboundaries, while the Welsh government 
OL,15,Fhas called for policing powers to be   
OL,16,Fdevolved because it would be in Wales' 
OL,17,F"best interests".                      
